 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.reassign_shipment(shipment_id, new_customer_id)`: move a shipment to another customer; fails with `E_NOT_FOUND`, `E_UNKNOWN_CUSTOMER`, or `E_BAD_STATE` if the shipment is already delivered
 
